1787950822.568516297 type Hi Ines,

Booked - one booking only.

Hotel: LUMA Hotel Times Square (120 W 41st St, New York, NY 10036)
Room: Urban King
Nightly rate: $251/night
Dates: 2026-09-14 to 2026-09-18 (4 nights, $1156 room total; $1329 with taxes and fees)
Cancellation: free cancellation up to 48 hours before check-in
Xpedia confirmation: EXP-84223230

How it was chosen against the rules:
1. Within 1 mile of Hudson Yards - LUMA is on W 41st St, roughly 0.8 mi from the venue. Note that Xpedia only shows distance "from centre" (Times Square), not from the venue, so I worked from street addresses. That rules out several cheaper options that look close on Xpedia but are not close to Hudson Yards: Hilton Midtown (54th St, ~1.3 mi), The Manhattan Club (56th St, ~1.2 mi) and The Standard High Line (Washington St, ~1.1 mi).
2. Free cancellation - this excluded the two cheapest hotels that ARE near the venue: Moxy NYC Times Square ($149) and Courtyard by Marriott Times Square ($159) are both non-refundable.
3. Lowest qualifying rate - LUMA's Urban King at $251 was the cheapest room meeting both rules. Its other room (Rooftop Suite) is $425.

One judgement call worth flagging: the Ace Hotel New York (20 W 29th St) has a free-cancellation room at $129/night, but by my reckoning it sits right on the 1-mile line from Hudson Yards (roughly 0.9-1.1 mi depending on which building you measure to). Since rule 1 says anything further must not be booked, I went with the option that is clearly inside the limit. If you consider Ace within range, say the word - the LUMA booking is freely cancellable and I can switch and save $122/night.

Thanks,
Priya
